    "note": "Structural XML diff of the pinned snapshot against the newly observed feed: supported_branches moved from 10.6.,11.3.,11.4. to 10.6.,11.3.,11.4.,12.0. and three releases were added (10.6.16, 11.4.6, 12.0.0-alpha1). Zero existing releases changed status, security coverage or release terms, and the insecure-term population is identical at 514 releases. Drupal Knowledge classifies branch_listed_in_source_supported_branches and source_supported_branches_presence_or_absence as non-authoritative signals that cannot drive finding conclusions, and the reviewed insecure-term semantic authority is scoped to drupal_core_majors 11, so a Drupal 12 branch resolves to candidate rather than confirmed via the existing cross-major guard. The reviewed release-lifecycle semantics therefore remain valid; only the source baseline was behind, so the context is re-normalized against the new snapshot without any semantic change.",
